# VetClinic

Rails veterinary clinic system with Pundit authorization.

# Setup

```bash
bundle install
bin/rails db:drop db:create db:migrate db:seed
bin/rails server
Requires libvips for image processing (sudo apt install libvips on Ubuntu).

Authorization

This application enforces three roles. Admins have full CRUD access to every resource. 
Vets have read-only access to Owners, Pets, and Vets, plus full control over their own assigned Appointments and Treatments; they may also edit their own Vet profile. 
Owners can manage their own Owner record, their own Pets, and Appointments for those Pets; they can view all Vets but cannot create or modify Treatments. 
All authorization checks are handled through Pundit policies and scopes, with UI controls hidden when the current user lacks permission.

